            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments of the present disclosure provide an information transmission method, device and a computer readable storage medium. The method includes: establishing an end-to-end adaptation layer in an L2 relay scenario; a function of the adaptation layer includes one or a combination: routing, bearer mapping.</p>
